    "The reset is the Umbrella Registry pointing 'Chain' to this contract; Fortress's oracle and ARTH's MAHA price feed both resolve the Chain through that registry. The fFTS collateral factor was set by the attacker's own governance proposal inside the exploit, so it is part of the attack, not a reset. This is the only zero-power submit on this Chain or its predecessor.",
